cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Entangled Alignment in your research, please cite the
  preprint below.
title: "Entangled Alignment: Learning Care During Capability Formation"
abstract: >-
  Companion implementation and artifacts for a research program that
  augments source text with synthetic chronological reader traces, uses
  an Understanding Graph for persistent memory and provenance, and tests
  a compact Reader Core as a candidate recurrent evaluative anchor.
